#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL1.1"
msgid "Awww, she has a cute little bow."
msgstr "噢，她有一个可爱的小蝴蝶结。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL1.2"
msgid "Awww, she has a cute little bow."
msgstr "噢，她有一个可爱的小蝴蝶结。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL2.1"
msgid "Awww, she has a cute little bow."
msgstr "噢，她有一个可爱的小蝴蝶结。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL2.2"
msgid "Awww, she has a cute little bow."
msgstr "噢，她有一个可爱的小蝴蝶结。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL3.1"
msgid "Awww, she has a cute little bow."
msgstr "噢，她有一个可爱的小蝴蝶结。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL3.2"
msgid "Awww, she has a cute little bow."
msgstr "噢，她有一个可爱的小蝴蝶结。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "It's hauntingly beautiful."
msgstr "太漂亮了，让人流连忘返。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_GROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_GROUND"
msgid "I'd die to find out what it does."
msgstr "我会查明它到底做了些什么。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_POCKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_POCKET"
msgid "I don't think I should hang on to this."
msgstr "我该放下它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL1"
msgid "Do you need some alone time?"
msgstr "你想一个人待着吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL2"
msgid "I think she's starting to open up to us."
msgstr "她准备跟我们吐露心扉了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL3"
msgid "Looks like someone's feeling especially spirited today!"
msgstr "精神头真足啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LONG"
msgid "It hurts my soul to look at that thing."
msgstr "看到那东西时，我的灵魂受伤了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.MEDIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.MEDIUM"
msgid "It's giving me the creeps."
msgstr "这让我毛骨悚然。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.SOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.SOON"
msgid "Something is up with that flower!"
msgstr "那朵花有情况！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.ACTIVATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.ACTIVATED"
msgid "How unoriginal!"
msgstr "真没创意！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm glad it's just a statue."
msgstr "还好只是一座雕像。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_TRIAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_TRIAL"
msgid "I've got some pull around here."
msgstr "那有个拉杆。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ACCOMPLISHMENT_SHRINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ACCOMPLISHMENT_SHRINE"
msgid "I want to use it, and I want the world to know that I did."
msgstr "我想用一下它，我想让全世界都知道我的所作所为。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ACORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ACORN"
msgid "There's definitely something inside there."
msgstr "里边绝对有东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ACORN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ACORN_COOKED"
msgid "Roasted to perfection."
msgstr "烤得很完美。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ACORN_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ACORN_SAPLING"
msgid "It'll be a tree soon!"
msgstr "它很快将长成一棵树！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ADVENTURE_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ADVENTURE_PORTAL"
msgid "I'm not sure I want to fall for that a second time."
msgstr "我不想再一次上当了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHAT"
msgid "It shows me infinite possibilities..."
msgstr "它让我看到了无限可能……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHATSHARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHATSHARD"
msgid "Even a single piece is pretty illuminating!"
msgstr "连部件都如此光彩夺目！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_CONTAINED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_CONTAINED"
msgid "It's draining the energy right out of that monster!"
msgstr "它正在耗尽那个怪物的能量！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.DEAD"
msgid "Gotcha!"
msgstr "有了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.GENERIC"
msgid "You'll pay for breaking all that science!"
msgstr "你会为破坏科学付出代价！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT"
msgid "You look the same but different."
msgstr "你看起来相同但又不同。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT_GESTALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT_GESTALT"
msgid "This must be the one he wants."
msgstr "这应该就是他想要的了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.DEAD"
msgid "This time I'm sure I got it."
msgstr "这回我很确定我收拾了它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.GENERIC"
msgid "I think I just made it angry..."
msgstr "我想我激怒它了……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2SPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2SPIKE"
msgid "You've made your point!"
msgstr "你已经表明了你的观点！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3"
msgid "It's definitely angry now!"
msgstr "它现在一定生气了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEAD"
msgid "Maybe someone should go poke it... just to be sure."
msgstr "应该找个人过去戳一下……这样才能确定。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEADORB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEADORB"
msgid "Is it dead? That strange energy still seems to be lingering around it."
msgstr "它死了吗？那股神秘的力量好像还在它附近游荡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3TRAP"
msgid "After rigorous testing, I can confirm that they make me want to take a nap."
msgstr "经过不懈测试，我可以确认它们让我想打盹。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE4_LUNARRIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE4_LUNARRIFT"
msgid "Haven't you broken enough science?!"
msgstr "你破坏的科学还不够多吗？！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.AMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.AMULET"
msgid "I feel so safe when I get to wear it."
msgstr "戴着它我感觉很安全。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR"
msgid "I wouldn't want my boat to float away."
msgstr "我可不想让小船飘走。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR_ITEM"
msgid "Now I can build an anchor."
msgstr "现在我能造出锚了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_GEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_GEM"
msgid "Hot and fresh off the tree."
msgstr "树上新鲜掉下来的，还热着呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION"
msgid "I just wish it was less... twitchy."
msgstr "要是能少……抽搐一点就好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION_COOKED"
msgid "At least it stopped twitching."
msgstr "这下起码不抽搐了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.GENERIC"
msgid "It's vegetable AND mineral. Fascinating."
msgstr "蔬菜与矿物质的化合物。奇特啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.STUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.STUMP"
msgid "This tree has been mined."
msgstr "这棵树已经被开采过了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.GENERIC"
msgid "Tree-t with caution."
msgstr "请谨慎树用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.STUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.STUMP"
msgid "It's a stump."
msgstr "一截树桩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "It's growing! I think?"
msgstr "它在长大！我觉得？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "It seems like it fits in, but it's not yet ready to grow."
msgstr "它看起来很适合，但还没准备要生长。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "I don't think it's getting the required nutrients here."
msgstr "这里给不了它所需的营养。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "I need to plant this in the right place."
msgstr "我得把它种在对的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SEED"
msgid "There are no surprises, only incomplete data."
msgstr "世上没有惊喜，只有不全面的统计。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR"
msgid "An ancient and mysterious structure."
msgstr "古老而神秘的建筑。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR_BROKEN"
msgid "This seems to be broken."
msgstr "这个好像破损了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_HUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_HUSK"
msgid "Something bad happened here."
msgstr "这里发生过不好的事情。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_STATUE"
msgid "It seems to throb out of tune with the world."
msgstr "它好像在与世界格格不入地震动。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANIMAL_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANIMAL_TRACK"
msgid "Tracks left by food. I mean... an animal."
msgstr "食物留下的踪迹。我指的是...一只动物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANTCHOVIES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANTCHOVIES"
msgid "Yeesh. Can I toss it back?"
msgstr "啊,我能丢回去吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.GENERIC"
msgid "It wants something from me."
msgstr "我身上有它想要的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.UNHAPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.UNHAPPY"
msgid "It looks mad."
msgstr "看起来很生气。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.VERYHAPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.VERYHAPPY"
msgid "I think we're on good terms."
msgstr "看起来跟我关系不错。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONHAT"
msgid "It's a groundbreaking scientific achievement."
msgstr "这是一项破土而出的科学成就。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONTRINKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONTRINKET"
msgid "Someone might be interested in this."
msgstr "有人可能对此感兴趣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE"
msgid "You won't centimpede my progress!"
msgstr "你休想阻止我进步！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE_HUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE_HUSK"
msgid "A pile of old spare parts."
msgstr "一堆旧零件。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.BURNT"
msgid "The pot got cooked."
msgstr "锅给烧没了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG"
msgid "This is going to take a while."
msgstr "这还需要一点时间。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT"
msgid "It's almost done!"
msgstr "就快好了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.DONE"
msgid "Mmmmm! It's ready to eat!"
msgstr "嗯！可以吃了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.EMPTY"
msgid "Let's dust off this old crockery, shall we?"
msgstr "把上面的灰尘先抖干净，怎么样？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX"
msgid "Now how do I get the knowledge out?"
msgstr "我怎么把知识取出来呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.GENERIC"
msgid "I have the strongest urge to stand around it and talk about nothing in particular."
msgstr "我有一种强烈的冲动，想站在它的周围侃侃而谈。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.POWEROFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.POWEROFF"
msgid "If only there was a way to get it working again..."
msgstr "要是有办法让它重新运作就好了……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_MOON_STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_MOON_STATUE"
msgid "These magnificent moon statues have me waxing poetic."
msgstr "这些宏伟的月亮雕像让我充满了诗意。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_ORCHESTRINA_MAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_ORCHESTRINA_MAIN"
msgid "It's like they made it puzzling on purpose."
msgstr "好像专门做成让人摸不着头脑的样子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Strange, the power is on but this isn't."
msgstr "奇怪，电源是开着的，但它却没反应。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.POWEROFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.POWEROFF"
msgid "Dead as a dead doornail."
msgstr "一点反应都没。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.GENERIC"
msgid "Why use a map when you could use a mind-bogglingly complex piece of machinery?"
msgstr "能用一个超级负责的机器，谁还要用地图？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.IDLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.IDLE"
msgid "It seems to have found everything worth finding."
msgstr "它似乎找到了值得被找到的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR_ITEM"
msgid "Aha! I used the secret knowledge to build a device! Why does this feel familiar..."
msgstr "啊哈！我运用秘密知识建造了一个设备！为什么这种感觉似曾相识呢……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_1"
msgid "So much knowledge, if only I could read it!"
msgstr "如此多的知识，我要是能看懂就好了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_2"
msgid "These markings look different from the ones in the rest of the ruins."
msgstr "这些标记看起来与其他废墟中的标记不同。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_3"
msgid "So much knowledge, if only I could read it!"
msgstr "如此多的知识，我要是能看懂就好了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_4"
msgid "These markings look different from the ones in the rest of the ruins."
msgstr "这些标记看起来与其他废墟中的标记不同。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_5"
msgid "So much knowledge, if only I could read it!"
msgstr "如此多的知识，我要是能看懂就好了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks inviting."
msgstr "它想亲近我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.POWEROFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.POWEROFF"
msgid "Whatever it did, it's not doing it anymore."
msgstr "它已经失去了从前的作用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_PULSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_PULSE"
msgid "Where are you going? Someplace interesting?"
msgstr "你这是要上哪去？是个有意思的地方吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.GEMS"
msgid "The socket is empty."
msgstr "这个插槽是空的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.VALID"
msgid "Those gems seem to power it... through entirely scientific means, I'm sure."
msgstr "它看起来是由这些宝石供能……十分科学，我敢肯定。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMORDRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMORDRAGONFLY"
msgid "Hot mail!"
msgstr "热呼呼的盔甲！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMORDREADSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMORDREADSTONE"
msgid "Lightweight, sturdy, and snazzy!"
msgstr "轻便、结实，时髦！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMORGRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMORGRASS"
msgid "Hopefully there aren't any bugs in it."
msgstr "希望里面没虫子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMORMARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMORMARBLE"
msgid "That looks really heavy."
msgstr "那看起来真的很沉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMORRUINS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMORRUINS"
msgid "It's oddly light."
msgstr "它轻得古怪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMORSKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMORSKELETON"
msgid "No bones about it."
msgstr "铮铮白骨"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMORSLURPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMORSLURPER"
msgid "A soggy, sustaining, succulent suit."
msgstr "一根湿漉漉的、帮助你抵抗饥饿的腰带。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMORSNURTLESHELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMORSNURTLESHELL"
msgid "It sticks to your back when you wear it."
msgstr "穿这衣服时，会粘在背上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMORWAGPUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMORWAGPUNK"
msgid "Fearsome and gearsome."
msgstr "令人敬畏的齿轮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMORWOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMORWOOD"
msgid "That is a perfectly reasonable piece of clothing."
msgstr "那是一件非常合适的衣服。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_BRAMBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_BRAMBLE"
msgid "The best offense is a good defense."
msgstr "防守是最好的进攻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_CARROTLURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_CARROTLURE"
msgid "I like a tight-knit bunch."
msgstr "我喜欢紧密团结的盔甲。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "This armor doesn't leaf any room for improvement."
msgstr "这盔甲再叶没有改进空间了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT_HUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT_HUSK"
msgid "That'll put a thorn in your side."
msgstr "它会给你身上扎根刺。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SANITY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SANITY"
msgid "Wearing that makes me feel safe and insecure."
msgstr "穿着我虽然安全了，心里确不踏实。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_VOIDCLOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_VOIDCLOTH"
msgid "Oh drat, there's a tear across the front!"
msgstr "哦，糟糕，前面撕开了一个口子！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_YOTH_KNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_YOTH_KNIGHT"
msgid "I'm saddled with questions."
msgstr "一堆疑问像马鞍一样重压着我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.BURNT"
msgid "\"Don't play with matches.\""
msgstr "“不要玩火柴。”"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.GENERIC"
msgid "It says \"Thataway\"."
msgstr "它说“那个方向”。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.UNWRITTEN"
msgid "The sign is currently blank."
msgstr "这块牌子现在是空白的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.BURNT"
msgid "\"Don't play with matches.\""
msgstr "“不要玩火柴。”"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.GENERIC"
msgid "It says \"Thataway\"."
msgstr "它说“那个方向”。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.UNWRITTEN"
msgid "The sign is currently blank."
msgstr "这块牌子现在是空白的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ASH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ASH.GENERIC"
msgid "All that's left after the fire has done its job."
msgstr "火烧完之后剩下的一切。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_EYE_BONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_EYE_BONE"
msgid "The eyebone was consumed by fire in the teleportation!"
msgstr "传送时，眼骨被火焰吞噬了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_GLOMMERFLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_GLOMMERFLOWER"
msgid "The flower was consumed by fire in the teleportation!"
msgstr "传送时，花被火焰吞噬了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE"
msgid "There's a perfectly scientific explanation for that."
msgstr "这肯定有个完美的科学解释。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS"
msgid "A vegetable."
msgstr "一种蔬菜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUSSOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUSSOUP"
msgid "Smells like it tastes."
msgstr "闻起来很好吃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_COOKED"
msgid "Science says it's good for me."
msgstr "科学说这对我有好处。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_OVERSIZED"
msgid "I guess we'll be eating asparagus for a while..."
msgstr "我想我们会吃一段时间的芦笋了……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_SEEDS"
msgid "It's some seeds."
msgstr "就是些种子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.CHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.CHARGING"
msgid "It's gaining power."
msgstr "它正在获得能量。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.COOLDOWN"
msgid "It needs time to recover. Me too."
msgstr "它需要时间恢复。我也是。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.DESTABILIZING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.DESTABILIZING"
msgid "The gateway is destabilizing."
msgstr "大门在晃动。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.OFF"
msgid "The essential components are still intact."
msgstr "主要部分依然完好无损。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.ON"
msgid "Back in working order."
msgstr "回到正常运转状态。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_KEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_KEY"
msgid "There is power emanating from it."
msgstr "它在向外发射能量。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.OFF"
msgid "Something must power it."
msgstr "它必须有动力来源。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.ON"
msgid "A truly unsettling light."
msgstr "非常令人不安的光。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_OVERGROWTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_OVERGROWTH"
msgid "I don't recognize any of these symbols."
msgstr "这些符号我一个都不认得。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_1"
msgid "It depicts an old civilization. The people look hungry and scared."
msgstr "它描绘了一个古老的文明。人们看起来又饿又怕。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_2"
msgid "This tablet is too worn to make out."
msgstr "这块石板已经无法识别了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_3"
msgid "Something dark creeps over the city and its people."
msgstr "有黑暗的东西悄悄逼近这座城市和城里的人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_4"
msgid "The people are shedding their skins. They look different underneath."
msgstr "人们的皮肤在脱落。他们的表里截然不同。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_5"
msgid "It shows a massive, technologically advanced city."
msgstr "这里描绘了一座科技发达的宏伟城市。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_STATUE"
msgid "It doesn't seem fully real."
msgstr "这看起来并不全是真的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.AXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.AXE"
msgid "A trusty axe."
msgstr "可靠的斧头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.GENERIC"
msgid "Awwww. So cute!"
msgstr "啊。太可爱了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.SLEEPING"
msgid "Sweet dreams, smelly."
msgstr "做个好梦，臭家伙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK"
msgid "You could fit a whole lot of science in there."
msgstr "你可以在那里面装进许多科学。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS"
msgid "The perfect breakfast for a man of science."
msgstr "适合科学家的完美早餐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BALATRO_MACHINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BALATRO_MACHINE"
msgid "I'm game for a game."
msgstr "我来玩一局吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BALLOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BALLOON"
msgid "How are they floating?"
msgstr "他们怎么漂浮的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BALLOONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BALLOONHAT"
msgid "The static does terrible things to my hair."
msgstr "静电把我的头发弄得很可怕。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BALLOONPARTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BALLOONPARTY"
msgid "How did he get the smaller balloons inside?"
msgstr "他怎么把小气球放进去的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.DEFLATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.DEFLATED"
msgid "Now it's just another balloon."
msgstr "所有气球都一样。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.GENERIC"
msgid "The hole in the center makes it more aerodynamic, that's just physics!"
msgstr "中间的孔让它更符合空气动力学，经典的物理学原理！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY"
msgid "It looks like clown currency."
msgstr "看起来像小丑货币。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BALLOONVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BALLOONVEST"
msgid "If the bright colors don't attract some horrible creature, the squeaking will."
msgstr "即使鲜艳的颜色不会引来可怕的生物，它吱吱的声音也会。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BANANABUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BANANABUSH"
msgid "That bush is bananas!"
msgstr "那片灌木丛是香蕉！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BANANAJUICE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BANANAJUICE"
msgid "Makes me feel a bit rogueish."
msgstr "有点落草为寇的感觉了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BANANAPOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BANANAPOP"
msgid "No, not brain freeze! I need that for science!"
msgstr "不，别冻大脑！我需要它来做科学研究！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE"
msgid "Seems sterile enough."
msgstr "似乎挺卫生的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE_BUTTERFLYWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE_BUTTERFLYWINGS"
msgid "This bandage is really winging it."
msgstr "都上绷带了，可得小心翼翼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE"
msgid "They don't look like knuckles to me."
msgstr "看着不像是指关节。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BARNACLEPITA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BARNACLEPITA"
msgid "Barnacles taste better when you can't see them."
msgstr "你看不见它们是藤壶的时候，它们的味道会更好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESTUFFEDFISHHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESTUFFEDFISHHEAD"
msgid "I'm just hungry enough to consider it..."
msgstr "我真是饿得够呛，居然连它都会考虑……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESUSHI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESUSHI"
msgid "I still seem to have misplaced my chopsticks."
msgstr "我的筷子好像还是放错了地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE_COOKED"
msgid "I'm told it's quite a delicacy."
msgstr "我听说这是一道珍馐美味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BARNACLINGUINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BARNACLINGUINE"
msgid "Pass the pasta!"
msgstr "把面递过来！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BASALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BASALT"
msgid "That's too strong to break through!"
msgstr "太硬了，敲不碎！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BAT"
msgid "Ack! That's terrifying!"
msgstr "啊！真可怕！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATBAT"
msgid "I bet I could fly if I held two of them."
msgstr "我敢打赌，如果我拿着其中俩个我就能飞起来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATCAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATCAVE"
msgid "I don't want to wake them."
msgstr "我可不想吵醒它们。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATHBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATHBOMB"
msgid "It's just textbook chemistry."
msgstr "教科书式的化学反应。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE"
msgid "Who knows whose nose this is?"
msgstr "有人知道这是谁的鼻子吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATNOSEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATNOSEHAT"
msgid "For hands-free dairy drinking."
msgstr "有了它喝奶都不用动手了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE_COOKED"
msgid "It came out smelling like a nose."
msgstr "出来的时候，闻到的是鼻子的味道。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_CONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_CONTAINER"
msgid "Wow, it stores so many songs."
msgstr "哇，它能存这么多歌。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_DURABILITY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_DURABILITY"
msgid "Theater makes me fidgety."
msgstr "戏剧让我坐立不安。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_FIRERESISTANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_FIRERESISTANCE"
msgid "I once burned my vest before seeing a play. I call that dramatic ironing."
msgstr "我有一次看戏前不小心把背心烧出个洞。我称此为戏剧性熨烫。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_HEALTHGAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_HEALTHGAIN"
msgid "Theater makes me fidgety."
msgstr "戏剧让我坐立不安。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_PANIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_PANIC"
msgid "I'm afraid I'm not a licensed poetic."
msgstr "恐怕我不是一个持照诗人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_REVIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_REVIVE"
msgid "It's a very lively tune."
msgstr "这首曲子太有生命力了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_TAUNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_TAUNT"
msgid "I'm afraid I'm not a licensed poetic."
msgstr "恐怕我不是一个持照诗人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_LUNARALIGNED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_LUNARALIGNED"
msgid "Theater makes me fidgety."
msgstr "戏剧让我坐立不安。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYAURA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYAURA"
msgid "Theater makes me fidgety."
msgstr "戏剧让我坐立不安。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYGAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYGAIN"
msgid "Theater makes me fidgety."
msgstr "戏剧让我坐立不安。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SHADOWALIGNED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SHADOWALIGNED"
msgid "Theater makes me fidgety."
msgstr "戏剧让我坐立不安。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATWING"
msgid "I hate those things, even when they're dead."
msgstr "那些东西即使死了都很讨厌。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATWING_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BATWING_COOKED"
msgid "At least it's not coming back."
msgstr "至少它不会再活过来了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR"
msgid "It's only gross when they're not your own."
msgstr "当它们不是你自己的时候才会恶心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEARGER"
msgid "What a bear of a badger."
msgstr "熊一样大的獾。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "That was close."
msgstr "好险。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "What an unbearable stench!"
msgstr "臭不可闻！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "There must be a scientific explanation for this!"
msgstr "这一定有科学的解释！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEARGERFUR_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEARGERFUR_SACK"
msgid "There's still fur on it. Chilling."
msgstr "上面还有它的毛。寒毛直竖啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEARGERVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEARGERVEST"
msgid "Welcome to the hibernation station!"
msgstr "欢迎来到冬眠站！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEARGER_FUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEARGER_FUR"
msgid "A mat of thick fur."
msgstr "一块厚毛皮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEAST_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEAST_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "I'm feeling lucky about this one!"
msgstr "我觉得我要走运了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_FURRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_FURRY"
msgid "It's so warm and comfy."
msgstr "真是又暖和又舒服。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_STRAW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_STRAW"
msgid "Looks comfy, but it smells like mildew."
msgstr "看起来挺舒适，但闻起来一股霉味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEE.GENERIC"
msgid "To bee or not to bee."
msgstr "嗡嗡嗡，嗡嗡嗡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEE.HELD"
msgid "Careful!"
msgstr "当心！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.BURNT"
msgid "How did it get burned?!!"
msgstr "怎么被烧掉的？！！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.FULLHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.FULLHONEY"
msgid "It's full of honey."
msgstr "它里面装满了蜂蜜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.GENERIC"
msgid "Bees!"
msgstr "蜜蜂！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.NOHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.NOHONEY"
msgid "It's empty."
msgstr "它是空的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.READY"
msgid "It's full of honey."
msgstr "它里面装满了蜂蜜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.SOMEHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.SOMEHONEY"
msgid "Need to wait a bit."
msgstr "需要等一会。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.BURNT"
msgid "How did it get burned?!!"
msgstr "怎么被烧掉的？！！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.FULLHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.FULLHONEY"
msgid "It's full of honey."
msgstr "它里面装满了蜂蜜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm sure there's a little sweetness to be found inside."
msgstr "不知道里面有没有些许甜蜜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.NOHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.NOHONEY"
msgid "It's empty."
msgstr "它是空的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.READY"
msgid "It's full of honey."
msgstr "它里面装满了蜂蜜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.SOMEHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.SOMEHONEY"
msgid "Need to wait a bit."
msgstr "需要等一会。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD"
msgid "It was a tough one."
msgstr "它很坚强。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD_MYPARTNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD_MYPARTNER"
msgid "I hope we meat again."
msgstr "希望我们能重逢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED"
msgid "This one is slightly less smelly than the others."
msgstr "这个没其他的那么臭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.FOLLOWER"
msgid "He's coming along peacefully."
msgstr "他在静静地跟着我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a beefalo!"
msgstr "是皮弗娄牛！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.MYPARTNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.MYPARTNER"
msgid "We're beef friends forever."
msgstr "我们永远都是朋友。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.NAKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.NAKED"
msgid "Aww, he's so sad."
msgstr "呃，他很伤心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.ORNERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.ORNERY"
msgid "It looks deeply angry."
msgstr "它看起来非常生气。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.PUDGY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.PUDGY"
msgid "Hmmm, there may be too much food inside it."
msgstr "嗯，它可能吃太多东西了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.RIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.RIDER"
msgid "This fellow appears quite ridable."
msgstr "这家伙看起来挺好骑的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.SLEEPING"
msgid "These guys are really heavy sleepers."
msgstr "这些家伙睡得真死。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOFEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOFEED"
msgid "None for me, thank you."
msgstr "我不要，谢谢你。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT"
msgid "That's a case of hat-hair waiting to happen."
msgstr "可以预见，我的发型要被帽子毁了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOTREAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOTREAT"
msgid "A bit too grainy for my taste."
msgstr "就我的口味而言，颗粒感太强了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOWOOL"
msgid "It smells like beefalo tears."
msgstr "闻起来像皮弗娄牛的眼泪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.BURNT"
msgid "I styled my beefalo in the hottest fashions... and paid the price."
msgstr "我用最火的风格打扮了我的皮弗娄牛……然而也付出了代价。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.GENERIC"
msgid "There's no beefalo here to groom."
msgstr "没有皮弗娄牛让我打扮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.OCCUPIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.OCCUPIED"
msgid "Let's beautify this beefalo!"
msgstr "让我们来美化一下这头皮弗娄牛！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER_ITEM"
msgid "I'd better set this up somewhere."
msgstr "我还是换个地方把它装起来吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEF_BELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEF_BELL"
msgid "It makes beefalo friendly. I'm sure there's a very scientific explanation."
msgstr "它会让皮弗娄牛变得友好。我相信科学对此一定有解释。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEGUARD"
msgid "It's guarding the queen."
msgstr "它正在守卫女王。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEHAT"
msgid "Protects your skin, but squashes your meticulous coiffure."
msgstr "保护你的皮肤，但会压坏你精心设计的发型。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEHIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEHIVE"
msgid "It's buzzing with activity."
msgstr "蜜蜂嗡嗡忙不停。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE"
msgid "It buzzes when shaken."
msgstr "它晃动时就会嗡嗡叫。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE_MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE_MAXWELL"
msgid "Bottled mosquito rage!"
msgstr "被装在地雷里的狂暴蚊子！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEEN"
msgid "Keep that stinger away from me!"
msgstr "让那蜂刺离我远点！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's too sticky to walk on."
msgstr "太黏了，没法走下去了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GROWING"
msgid "Was that there before?"
msgstr "那东西以前在那里吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVEGROWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVEGROWN"
msgid "How in science did it get so big?!"
msgstr "不科学啊，它是怎么长到这么大的？！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX"
msgid "Beeswax is a scientifically proven preservative!"
msgstr "科学证明蜂蜡可以防腐！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX_SPRAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX_SPRAY"
msgid "Is that formaldehyde I smell?"
msgstr "我是闻到甲醛了吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEETLETAUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BEETLETAUR"
msgid "I can smell him from here!"
msgstr "我在这里都能闻到他的气味！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BELL"
msgid "Dingalingaling."
msgstr "叮呤呤。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_ACTIVE"
msgid "That teddy bear is moving around. Interesting."
msgstr "泰迪熊在四处溜达。好好玩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_BIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_BIG"
msgid "Remind me not to get on Willow's bad side."
msgstr "千万不要惹薇洛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.BROKEN"
msgid "It finally fell apart."
msgstr "它最终土崩瓦解。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's all scorched."
msgstr "它全烧焦了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRIES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRIES"
msgid "Red berries taste the best."
msgstr "红色浆果最好吃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED"
msgid "I don't think heat improved them."
msgstr "我认为加热并没有让它们变得更好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY"
msgid "Extra tasty, though they won't last long."
msgstr "非常美味，虽然美味稍纵即逝。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY_COOKED"
msgid "Better eat them before they spoil!"
msgstr "最好在变质前吃掉！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BARREN"
msgid "I think it needs to be fertilized."
msgstr "我想它需要施肥。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BURNING"
msgid "It's very much on fire."
msgstr "它大部分都着火了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASED"
msgid "It looks pretty sick."
msgstr "看上去病的很重。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASING"
msgid "Err, something's not right."
msgstr "呃...有些地方不对劲。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.GENERIC"
msgid "I think those are the edible kind."
msgstr "我觉得这些应该能吃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.PICKED"
msgid "Maybe they'll grow back?"
msgstr "或许它们会再长出来？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.WITHERED"
msgid "Nothing will grow in this heat."
msgstr "这么热的天气什么也生长不了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BARREN"
msgid "It won't make any berries in this state."
msgstr "在这种状态下，它长不出浆果。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BURNING"
msgid "It's very much on fire."
msgstr "它大部分都着火了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASED"
msgid "It looks pretty sick."
msgstr "它看上去很不舒服。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASING"
msgid "Err, something's not right."
msgstr "呃...有些地方不对劲。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.GENERIC"
msgid "I should leave them there until it's time to eat."
msgstr "我应该把他们留到吃饭时间。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.PICKED"
msgid "The bush is working hard on the next batch."
msgstr "下一批丛林在努力生长。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.WITHERED"
msgid "The heat even dehydrated the juicy berries!"
msgstr "高温将多汁的浆果脱水！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYSAUCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYSAUCE"
msgid "Equal parts merry and berry."
msgstr "浆果果酱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIBINGKA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIBINGKA"
msgid "Soft and spongy."
msgstr "像海绵一样软。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT"
msgid "That is one biiig foot."
msgstr "那真是一只巨大无比的脚。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRCHNUTDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRCHNUTDRAKE"
msgid "A mad little nut."
msgstr "疯狂的小坚果。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.DEAD"
msgid "Maybe he's just resting?"
msgstr "也许它只是在休息？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.GENERIC"
msgid "Now it just needs a bird."
msgstr "现在只需要一只鸟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.HUNGRY"
msgid "He's looking a bit peckish."
msgstr "它看起来有点饿。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED"
msgid "Who's a good bird?"
msgstr "谁是好鸟？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON"
msgid "That bird is definitely deceased."
msgstr "那只鸟肯定死了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SLEEPING"
msgid "Awwww, he's asleep."
msgstr "哇哦，他睡着了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING"
msgid "Has no one fed you in awhile?"
msgstr "好久都没人喂食了吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "That's what I call a firebird."
msgstr "这才叫真正的火鸟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "I call fowl."
msgstr "实乃禽兽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "It's becoming a new species!"
msgstr "它正在变成新物种！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRDTRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRDTRAP"
msgid "Gives me a net advantage!"
msgstr "蛛网带来的收益！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG"
msgid "A small, normal egg."
msgstr "一颗正常的、小小的鸟蛋。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED"
msgid "Sunny side yum!"
msgstr "真好吃！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT"
msgid "I think that used to be a crow."
msgstr "我觉得那个以前应该是只乌鸦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT_SPITTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT_SPITTER"
msgid "I don't like the way it's looking at me..."
msgstr "我不喜欢它盯着我的眼神……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BISHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BISHOP"
msgid "Back off, preacherman!"
msgstr "退后，传教士！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_CHARGE_HIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_CHARGE_HIT"
msgid "Ow!"
msgstr "噢！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "It's falling apart!"
msgstr "它在分崩离析！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLACKFLAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLACKFLAG"
msgid "Gentleman Pirate-Scientist does have a bit of a ring to it."
msgstr "绅士海盗-科学家这名号还真有点上口。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FIRE"
msgid "This seems fundamentally unsafe."
msgstr "这东西似乎根本不安全。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA"
msgid "That's a weapon I could use from range."
msgstr "我可以在范围内用这个武器。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA2"
msgid "It uses a strong blast of air to propel a projectile."
msgstr "它利用一股强气流来推动抛射物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_PIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_PIPE"
msgid "Good practice for my birthday cake!"
msgstr "我可以好好练习怎么吹生日蜡烛！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP"
msgid "Just don't breathe in."
msgstr "不要倒吸进去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_YELLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_YELLOW"
msgid "It has shocking accuracy."
msgstr "它的准确性令人震惊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLUEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLUEAMULET"
msgid "Cool as ice!"
msgstr "像冰一样冷！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLUEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLUEGEM"
msgid "It sparkles with cold energy."
msgstr "它散发着冰冷能量的光芒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLUEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLUEMOONEYE"
msgid "It's always smart to keep an eye out."
msgstr "留个心眼总是比较明智的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.COMMON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.COMMON"
msgid "It's scientific!"
msgstr "科学啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.RARE"
msgid "It's REALLY scientific!"
msgstr "太科学了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP"
msgid "It's weird and gooey."
msgstr "它很古怪，还黏黏的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "It's different now..."
msgstr "这回不一样了……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a mushroom."
msgstr "是蘑菇。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
msgid "It's sleeping."
msgstr "它在睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "I wonder if it will come back?"
msgstr "不知道它会不会长回来？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOARDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOARDS"
msgid "Boards."
msgstr "木板。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOARON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOARON"
msgid "I can take him!"
msgstr "我可以应对他！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOARRIOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOARRIOR"
msgid "You sure are big!"
msgstr "你可真大！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT03
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT03"
msgid "Not much left of it."
msgstr "就剩下了这一点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT04
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT04"
msgid "Not much left of it."
msgstr "就剩下了这一点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT05
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT05"
msgid "Not much left of it."
msgstr "就剩下了这一点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH"
msgid "Just in case of disaster."
msgstr "以防不测。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH_KELP"
msgid "It'll have to do for now."
msgstr "现在只能这样了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT"
msgid "There's the checkpoint!"
msgstr "检查点就在那！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT"
msgid "One more thing to check off my list."
msgstr "我的清单上又多了一件要检查的事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_PRIMEMATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_PRIMEMATE"
msgid "Someone's shadowing me!"
msgstr "有人对我如影随形！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK"
msgid "Buoy oh buoy!"
msgstr "浮标啊浮标！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY"
msgid "Buoy oh buoy!"
msgstr "浮标啊浮标！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT"
msgid "Buoy oh buoy!"
msgstr "浮标啊浮标！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT"
msgid "Buoy oh buoy!"
msgstr "浮标啊浮标！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SPECTATOR_DRAGONLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SPECTATOR_DRAGONLING"
msgid "Its support is getting me all fired up!"
msgstr "它的支持让我燃了起来！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START"
msgid "You have to start somewhere."
msgstr "总得有个起点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT"
msgid "Where to start?"
msgstr "起点放在哪呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_CONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_CONTAINER"
msgid "\"Cargo\" is sailor-lingo for \"stuff\"."
msgstr "“货物”是水手们的黑话，意思就是 “东西”。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_ITEM"
msgid "I guess I'm doing this the old-fashioned way."
msgstr "还是得用老法子来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING"
msgid "It's my boat's crowning glory."
msgstr "它在我的小船上闪耀着王冠的光芒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING_KIT"
msgid "A soon-to-be boat bumper."
msgstr "一个即将到来的船用保险杠。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP"
msgid "It won't save the boat from everything, but it sure kelps."
msgstr "虽然不能解决小船的所有问题，但也起到了海带应有的作用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP_KIT"
msgid "A soon-to-be boat bumper."
msgstr "一个即将到来的船用保险杠。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL"
msgid "It gives the boat a little shellf defense."
msgstr "能给小船提供一个小的防御外壳。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL_KIT"
msgid "A soon-to-be boat bumper."
msgstr "一个即将到来的船用保险杠。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD"
msgid "When you mess with a dragon boat, you get the horns!"
msgstr "和龙舟角力？你会尝到龙角的滋味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD_KIT"
msgid "A soon-to-be boat bumper."
msgstr "一个即将到来的船用保险杠。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.AMMOLOADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.AMMOLOADED"
msgid "The cannon is ready to fire!"
msgstr "大炮已经准备好开火了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.GENERIC"
msgid "I should load it with something."
msgstr "我应该找东西装填进去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.NOAMMO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.NOAMMO"
msgid "I didn't forget the cannonballs, I'm just letting the anticipation build."
msgstr "我没忘记炮弹的事，我只是在酝酿群众的期待。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON_KIT"
msgid "It's not a cannon yet, but it will be."
msgstr "现在还不是大炮，不过将来会是。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_GRASS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_GRASS_ITEM"
msgid "It's technically a boat."
msgstr "从技术上讲，这是一条船。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ITEM"
msgid "It would be nice to do some experiments on the water."
msgstr "在水上做些实验挺不错的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LEAK"
msgid "I should patch that up before we sink."
msgstr "要补漏，不然会沉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.ACTIVATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.ACTIVATED"
msgid "It's working!! Er, I knew it would work, of course."
msgstr "奏效了！！呃，我当然一早就知道它能行。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm always drawn to physics, like a... ah, can't think of the word."
msgstr "一直以来我都被物理学所吸引，就像……一样，怎么想不起那个词了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.ACTIVATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.ACTIVATED"
msgid "Magnetism!"
msgstr "磁力！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.GENERIC"
msgid "This will attract any strong magnets nearby."
msgstr "附近只要有强磁铁就会受到它的吸引。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_KIT"
msgid "One of my more genius ideas, if I do say so myself."
msgstr "可以这么讲，这只是我的天才创意之一。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR"
msgid "Things are going in the right direction. Or maybe the left."
msgstr "事情正朝着正确的方向发展。这个方向非左即右。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR_KIT"
msgid "I think I'll take it out for a spin."
msgstr "我想我要带它出去转转。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL"
msgid "If only it didn't also smell like a beefalo."
msgstr "要是它闻起来不像皮弗娄牛就好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_KELP"
msgid "It's soggier than I would like."
msgstr "我不喜欢这么潮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_PETALS"
msgid "At least it smells nicer than the beefalo pillow."
msgstr "起码比皮弗娄牛枕头好闻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_STEELWOOL"
msgid "Who would sleep on this?"
msgstr "谁会睡在这上面？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "Botany and chemistry, working together."
msgstr "植物学和化学一起奏效。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT_WORMWOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT_WORMWOOD"
msgid "Our friend seems to be getting more in touch with his lunar roots."
msgstr "我们的朋友似乎对他的月亮根源有了更多的接触。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD"
msgid "Bits of bone."
msgstr "一小片骨头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BONESOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BONESOUP"
msgid "No bones about it, Warly can cook."
msgstr "沃利骨子里是名好厨师。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW"
msgid "A stew to put some meat on your bones."
msgstr "能让我的骨头上长点肉的炖菜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.BURNT"
msgid "I think the library's closed."
msgstr "看来图书馆关门了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.GENERIC"
msgid "Why study when I can experiment?"
msgstr "能做实验谁要学习？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BEES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BEES"
msgid "I don't get all the buzz around this one."
msgstr "我不理解这本书为什么会嗡嗡响。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS"
msgid "No point studying when I can just wing it."
msgstr "一本鸟书。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE"
msgid "The beginning was dull, but got better near the end."
msgstr "开头很无聊，但将近结尾就变好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL"
msgid "I can't make out the text."
msgstr "我看不清这些字。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FIRE"
msgid "I don't feel a burning need to read it."
msgstr "并没有心急火燎的阅读冲动。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FISH"
msgid "It didn't really hook me."
msgstr "它并没有让我上钩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL"
msgid "This'll keep those monsters held for a little while."
msgstr "这样能把那些怪物拖住一阵子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING"
msgid "I see no farm in reading that."
msgstr "读了半天没看到一个农场。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE"
msgid "I see no farm in reading that."
msgstr "读了半天没看到一个农场。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE_UPGRADED"
msgid "It's about as exciting as watching grass grow."
msgstr "书中内容大约和盯着草长高一样精彩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT"
msgid "Whoever wrote this must've been pretty bright."
msgstr "写这本书的人头脑相当灵光。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT_UPGRADED"
msgid "Brilliant!"
msgstr "光芒万丈！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_MOON"
msgid "All this interest in the moon is probably just a phase."
msgstr "所有这些对月亮的兴趣可能只是阶段性的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RAIN"
msgid "That doesn't sound very scientific."
msgstr "听上去不是十分科学。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RESEARCH_STATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RESEARCH_STATION"
msgid "Wickerbottom likes to do everything by the book."
msgstr "薇克巴顿喜欢跟随书籍的指导。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SILVICULTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SILVICULTURE"
msgid "I'll stick to my own experiments."
msgstr "我还是坚持自己的实验吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP"
msgid "Strange, it's just 500 pages of telegraph codes."
msgstr "奇怪，这只是五百页的电报码。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TEMPERATURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TEMPERATURE"
msgid "My thoughts on it are only lukewarm."
msgstr "我对它的想法不温不火。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES"
msgid "Someone'll get suckered into reading this."
msgstr "有人会被拖着去读这本书。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_WEB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_WEB"
msgid "I'm not scared of spiders! I'm not!"
msgstr "我不怕蜘蛛的！我不怕！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG"
msgid "Aerodynamical!"
msgstr "空气动力学！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOTLEG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOTLEG"
msgid "Somewhere out there, a pirate is missing their bootie."
msgstr "远方的远方，有个海盗丢了靴子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FORGEDITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FORGEDITEM"
msgid "It's broken, but I think I could repair it."
msgstr "它破损了，但是我可以把它修好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FUMAROLETOOLITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FUMAROLETOOLITEM"
msgid "If I get it hot enough, I could melt the pieces back together."
msgstr "温度够高的话，我没准能把碎片融化然后接回去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BRUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BRUSH"
msgid "I bet the beefalo really like this."
msgstr "皮弗娄牛肯定很喜欢这个。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUGNET"
msgid "For catching bugs."
msgstr "抓虫子用的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.GENERIC"
msgid "Welp. It's kelp."
msgstr "不赖，海带。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.PICKED"
msgid "I just couldn't kelp myself."
msgstr "海带让我激动难耐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_ROOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_ROOT"
msgid "I can plant it in deep water."
msgstr "可以种在深海里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUNDLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUNDLE"
msgid "Our supplies are in there!"
msgstr "我们的物资都在那里面！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUNDLEWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUNDLEWRAP"
msgid "Wrapping things up should make them easier to carry."
msgstr "把东西打包起来应该会容易搬一点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUNNYMAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUNNYMAN"
msgid "I am filled with an irresistible urge to do science."
msgstr "我要马上搞科研，饥渴难耐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUNNYSTEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUNNYSTEW"
msgid "This one's luck has run out."
msgstr "这家伙的运气到头了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BURNT_MARSH_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BURNT_MARSH_BUSH"
msgid "It's all burnt up."
msgstr "被烧得精光。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT"
msgid "It's kind of scratchy."
msgstr "看着有点扎人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUTTER"
msgid "I can't believe it's butter!"
msgstr "我无法相信这是黄油！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.GENERIC"
msgid "Butterfly, flutter by."
msgstr "蝴蝶，扑扑翅膀飞走了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.HELD"
msgid "Now I have you!"
msgstr "总算抓到你了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN"
msgid "We threw the recipe away and just kind of winged it."
msgstr "我们扔掉了食谱，即兴发挥了一下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYWINGS"
msgid "Without these, it's just a butter."
msgstr "没了这些，它只是条毛虫。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUZZARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUZZARD"
msgid "What a bizarre buzzard!"
msgstr "多么丑怪的一只秃鹫！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "That's what I call a firebird."
msgstr "这才叫真正的火鸟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "I call fowl."
msgstr "实乃禽兽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "It's becoming a new species!"
msgstr "它正在变成新物种！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CABBAGEROLLS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CABBAGEROLLS"
msgid "The meat hides inside the cabbage to avoid predators."
msgstr "肉躲在白菜里面躲避天敌。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.GENERIC"
msgid "Sharp but delicious."
msgstr "虽然有刺，但很美味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.PICKED"
msgid "Deflated, but still spiny."
msgstr "干瘪了，但还是很多刺。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_FLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_FLOWER"
msgid "A pretty flower from a prickly plant."
msgstr "多刺植物开出的美丽花朵。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT"
msgid "There are still some spines between me and a tasty meal."
msgstr "要想把它变成一顿美味，还需要把上面的刺弄掉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT_COOKED"
msgid "Grilled fruit of the desert."
msgstr "来自沙漠的烤水果。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CALIFORNIAROLL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CALIFORNIAROLL"
msgid "But I don't have chopsticks."
msgstr "但我没有筷子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.EMBERS"
msgid "That fire needs more fuel or it's going to go out."
msgstr "得加燃料了，不然火就要灭了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.GENERIC"
msgid "Sure beats darkness."
msgstr "肯定能驱走黑暗。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.HIGH"
msgid "That fire is getting out of hand!"
msgstr "火要失控了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.LOW"
msgid "The fire's getting a bit low."
msgstr "火变得有点小了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.NORMAL"
msgid "Nice and comfy."
msgstr "真舒服。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.OUT"
msgid "Well, that's over."
msgstr "哦，火灭了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CANARY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CANARY.GENERIC"
msgid "Some sort of yellow creature made of science."
msgstr "某种科学制成的黄色生物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CANARY.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CANARY.HELD"
msgid "I'm not squishing you, am I?"
msgstr "我并没有在压扁你，不是吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CANARY_POISONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CANARY_POISONED"
msgid "It's probably fine."
msgstr "它可能是好的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CANDYBAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CANDYBAG"
msgid "It's some sort of delicious pocket dimension for sugary treats."
msgstr "它是某种美味的小小的甜点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CANE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CANE"
msgid "Technically walking is just controlled falling."
msgstr "从技术上讲，走路就是有控制的跌倒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CANNONBALL_ROCK_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CANNONBALL_ROCK_ITEM"
msgid "This will fit into a cannon perfectly."
msgstr "它能完美地装进炮膛里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.COOLDOWN"
msgid "What a blast!"
msgstr "太炸了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.GENERIC"
msgid "This experiment blows up on purpose!"
msgstr "这个实验的目的就是爆炸！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON_KIT"
msgid "I've got a lot of experience in making things explode."
msgstr "我在把东西弄炸方面积累了丰富的经验。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER"
msgid "I think all these shiny decorations reflect well on me."
msgstr "这些闪亮的装饰品已经说明了一切。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER_KIT"
msgid "I have to build it myself? I should have known there'd be a catch."
msgstr "我必须自己建造它？我早该料到的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE"
msgid "I could watch it for hours."
msgstr "我可以几个小时一直盯着它看。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE_KIT"
msgid "I hope this prize is all it's cracked up to be."
msgstr "希望奖品就只是这些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.GENERIC"
msgid "I seem to be getting a lot of these..."
msgstr "我怎么弄到这么多的这些东西……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.RARE"
msgid "See? Proof that trying the exact same thing over and over will eventually lead to success!"
msgstr "看到没？重复做同样的事情终究会取得成功，这就是证据！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.UNCOMMON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.UNCOMMON"
msgid "You don't see this kind of design too often."
msgstr "这种设计不是很常见。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT"
msgid "The thrill of discovery!"
msgstr "探索的刺激！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON2"
msgid "The thrill of discovery!"
msgstr "探索的刺激！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON3"
msgid "The thrill of discovery!"
msgstr "探索的刺激！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP"
msgid "It's powered by whimsy."
msgstr "它的能量来自于奇思妙想。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP_KIT"
msgid "Only some light work left to do."
msgstr "光剩下一点工作了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT"
msgid "Either it's small, or I'm gigantic."
msgstr "不是它小，就是我大。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT_KIT"
msgid "Maybe it's a boxwood?"
msgstr "也许这是一棵黄杨？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALFOOD_CORNTEA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALFOOD_CORNTEA"
msgid "Is this drink supposed to be crunchy?"
msgstr "这种饮料本该这么松脆吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_FOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_FOOD"
msgid "I don't need to chew them up first, do I?"
msgstr "我不需要先把它们嚼碎，对吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_KIT"
msgid "This really is a pop-up carnival."
msgstr "这还真是个快闪嘉年华。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_NEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_NEST"
msgid "It's a little trapdoor."
msgstr "这是一扇小活门。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "It won't let me play until I give it something shiny."
msgstr "它要我给它一些闪亮的东西才让我玩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "This looks like fun!"
msgstr "这个看起来有趣喔！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFBALL"
msgid "I've seen you round here!"
msgstr "我“圆”来见过你！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFCLUB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFCLUB"
msgid "Putter up!"
msgstr "推杆准备！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_DIY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_DIY"
msgid "Hm, there must be a formula to the perfect mini-golf course."
msgstr "嗯，一定有个公式指导建造完美的迷你高尔夫球场。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_EASY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_EASY"
msgid "The physics should be forgiving here."
msgstr "这里的物理限制应该比较宽松。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_HARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_HARD"
msgid "This may require more calculation."
msgstr "这可能需要更多计算。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_MEDIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_MEDIUM"
msgid "I'll give it a shot."
msgstr "我来试试看。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_CUTOUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_CUTOUT"
msgid "It's just in the way."
msgstr "纯粹就是挡路。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_FAN"
msgid "I'm not blown away by it."
msgstr "它可吹不走我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_FENCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_FENCE"
msgid "There's no getting around that."
msgstr "这个可绕不过去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_MOVINGWALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_MOVINGWALL"
msgid "The obstacle has its ups and downs."
msgstr "这个障碍物历经了起起落落。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_SPINNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_SPINNER"
msgid "It's really turning things around."
msgstr "它果真扭转了局面。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_SPRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_SPRING"
msgid "And they say there's no such thing as a free launch!"
msgstr "谁说天下没有免费的发射！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_WORMHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_WORMHOLE"
msgid "I wish I could study how the two ends connect, but it might be gross."
msgstr "我真想研究一下这两端是怎么连接的，不过可能会有点恶心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_HOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_HOLE"
msgid "I'll putt the ball right in there."
msgstr "我会把球推进那里面。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_HOLE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_HOLE_KIT"
msgid "Where to end?"
msgstr "终点放在哪里呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.GENERIC"
