#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST"
msgid "This contest is going to go off without a hitch! Well, figuratively speaking."
msgstr "这场比赛将会顺利进行！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST_ITEM"
msgid "I'd better get that set up."
msgstr "我最好先装好它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE"
