msgstr "一场耳朵的盛宴！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DANGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DANGER"
msgid "A feast for the ears!"
msgstr "一场耳朵的盛宴！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DAWN"
