msgstr "所有节日盛宴的主菜！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC"
