msgstr "这看起来不像我见过的任何缝纫图案。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET"
