msgstr "嘿……里面那个是条鱼吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_PILLAR"
