msgstr "我好像总和这个世界格格不入。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING1"
