msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.BIRDSBLOCKED"
msgid "Of course, the force field applies to the birds too."
msgstr "力场自然对鸟类同样有效。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.DEADBIRDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.DEADBIRDS"
msgid "Oh, dear. I'm afraid the sky is not safe for birds right now."
msgstr "噢，天啊。恐怕天空现在对鸟类来说已经不安全了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.GENERIC"
msgid "Other matters await."
msgstr "还有其他事在等着。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.NOBIRDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.NOBIRDS"
msgid "The birds are not keen on this weather."
msgstr "鸟不喜欢这种天气。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.NOFIRES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.NOFIRES"
msgid "Thankfully, there are no fires to put out."
msgstr "所幸没有需要扑灭的明火。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.NOHORTICULTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.NOHORTICULTURE"
msgid "There are no crops to cultivate."
msgstr "没有能种的庄稼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.NOMOONINCAVES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.NOMOONINCAVES"
msgid "The moon can't be affected from this subterranean location."
msgstr "这个地下位置影响不到月亮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.NOSILVICULTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.NOSILVICULTURE"
msgid "There are no arboreal subjects to focus on."
msgstr "没有可聚焦的树栖主体。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.NOSLEEPTARGETS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.NOSLEEPTARGETS"
msgid "I don't see anyone in need of a bedtime story."
msgstr "我没看到谁需要睡前故事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.NOTENTACLEGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.NOTENTACLEGROUND"
msgid "The tentacles would be unable to break the surface here."
msgstr "触手无法突破这里的地表。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.NOWATERNEARBY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.NOWATERNEARBY"
msgid "Fish may only be summoned in close proximity to a body of water."
msgstr "鱼类只能在水体附近被召唤出来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.TOOMANYBEES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.TOOMANYBEES"
msgid "That would be a rather excessive amount of bees, dear."
msgstr "那样就太多蜜蜂了，亲爱的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.TOOMANYBIRDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.TOOMANYBIRDS"
msgid "It doesn't work as well with this many birds around."
msgstr "地上鸟太多了，魔法没那么有效。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.WAYTOOMANYBIRDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.WAYTOOMANYBIRDS"
msgid "The sky is out of birds for now."
msgstr "现在天上一只鸟都没有了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.REMOTE_TELEPORT.NODEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.REMOTE_TELEPORT.NODEST"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.REMOTE_TELEPORT.NOSKILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.REMOTE_TELEPORT.NOSKILL"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.REMOVEMODULES.NO_MODULES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.REMOVEMODULES.NO_MODULES"
msgid "only_used_by_wx78"
msgstr "only_used_by_wx78"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.REPAIR.WRONGPIECE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.REPAIR.WRONGPIECE"
msgid "That is clearly the incorrect piece."
msgstr "那明显不是正确的棋子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.REPLATE.MISMATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.REPLATE.MISMATCH"
msgid "That's not the proper dinnerware for this food."
msgstr "它不是盛放这种食物的餐具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.REPLATE.SAMEDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.REPLATE.SAMEDISH"
msgid "It's already on the proper dinnerware."
msgstr "它已经装在合适的餐具中了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING0
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING0"
msgid "I must time this perfectly."
msgstr "我得找个完美的时机。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING1"
msgid "This might take some tenacity."
msgstr "我会坚韧不拔的试下去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING2"
msgid "Oh dear, I'll have to start over."
msgstr "哦，天啊，我得从头来过了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.GENERIC"
msgid "I've other things on my mind currently."
msgstr "我现在脑子里还想着别的事情。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.INUSE"
msgid "Be sure to sort by color and weight, dear."
msgstr "请务必按颜色和重量分类，亲爱的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTAMERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTAMERM"
msgid "I don't believe the locals would take kindly to that."
msgstr "我不相信本地人会喜欢这种行为。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTAROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTAROBOT"
msgid "It is the property of the automaton."
msgstr "它是机器人的财产。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTMASTERCHEF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTMASTERCHEF"
msgid "It would be rude of me to tamper with it."
msgstr "我不该乱动，太不礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTSOULJARHANDLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTSOULJARHANDLER"
msgid "Best not interfere."
msgstr "最好别插手。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.RESTRICTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.RESTRICTED"
msgid "It's not for me, I'm afraid."
msgstr "恐怕这不是给我的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.SADDLE.TARGETINCOMBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.SADDLE.TARGETINCOMBAT"
msgid "It would be ill-advised to approach that scuffle."
msgstr "靠近那场混战可不是个好主意。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.AWAKEBEEFALO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.AWAKEBEEFALO"
msgid "I think he might object to that."
msgstr "我觉得他可能会抗议。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.GENERIC"
msgid "I would really rather not."
msgstr "我真的不想这么做。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.NOBITS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.NOBITS"
msgid "It's already smooth, dear."
msgstr "已经剃干净了，亲爱的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.SOMEONEELSESBEEFALO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.SOMEONEELSESBEEFALO"
msgid "It's not my place to shave someone else's beefalo."
msgstr "我去薅别人皮弗娄牛的毛不是很合适。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.SLAUGHTER.TOOFAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.SLAUGHTER.TOOFAR"
msgid "Oh dear, it got away."
msgstr "哎呀，它逃走了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.SOAKIN.NOSPACE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.SOAKIN.NOSPACE"
msgid "There's clearly someone sitting there already."
msgstr "显然已经有人坐在那儿了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.START_CARRAT_RACE.NO_RACERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.START_CARRAT_RACE.NO_RACERS"
msgid "I can't gather any data with no subjects."
msgstr "没有对象，我收集不到任何数据。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's full to the brim, I'm afraid."
msgstr "恐怕它已经装满了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.INUSE"
msgid "I do hope you're keeping organized, my dear."
msgstr "我真希望你保持有条理，亲爱的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTALLOWED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTALLOWED"
msgid "Nonsense."
msgstr "胡闹。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTAROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTAROBOT"
msgid "It is the property of the automaton."
msgstr "它是机器人的财产。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTMASTERCHEF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTMASTERCHEF"
msgid "It would be rude of me to tamper with it."
msgstr "我不该乱动，太不礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTSOULJARHANDLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTSOULJARHANDLER"
msgid "Best not interfere."
msgstr "最好别插手。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.RESTRICTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.RESTRICTED"
msgid "It's not for me, I'm afraid."
msgstr "恐怕这不是给我的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.CANTLEARN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.CANTLEARN"
msgid "A piece of knowledge I cannot grasp... Intriguing!"
msgstr "一条我领悟不了的知识...有趣！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.KNOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.KNOWN"
msgid "Please. That knowledge is child's play."
msgstr "拜托，这些知识简直太小儿科了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.MESSAGEBOTTLEMANAGER_NOT_FOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.MESSAGEBOTTLEMANAGER_NOT_FOUND"
msgid "It's much too dark to make any sense of this."
msgstr "太黑了，看不清写了些什么。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.STASH_MAP_NOT_FOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.STASH_MAP_NOT_FOUND"
msgid "The apes seem to have neglected to mark any particular sites on this map."
msgstr "猿猴们忽略了应该在这张地图上做标记。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.WRONGWORLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.WRONGWORLD"
msgid "This map is for some other location."
msgstr "这张地图是用在其他地点的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.TELLSTORY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.TELLSTORY.GENERIC"
msgid "only_used_by_walter"
msgstr "only_used_by_walter"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.BEEF_BELL_ALREADY_USED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.BEEF_BELL_ALREADY_USED"
msgid "It's already formed a bond with someone else, dear."
msgstr "它已经和别人建立了联系，亲爱的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.BEEF_BELL_HAS_BEEF_ALREADY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.BEEF_BELL_HAS_BEEF_ALREADY"
msgid "I don't require any more beefalo."
msgstr "我不需要更多的皮弗娄牛了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.BEEF_BELL_INVALID_TARGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.BEEF_BELL_INVALID_TARGET"
msgid "That won't do."
msgstr "那样不行。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.CANNOT_FIX_DRONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.CANNOT_FIX_DRONE"
msgid "It is simply irreparable."
msgstr "根本无法修复。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.NOT_MINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.NOT_MINE"
msgid "It does not belong to me."
msgstr "那个不属于我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.KLAUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.KLAUS"
msgid "The beast must first be defeated."
msgstr "首先必须打败那头野兽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.QUAGMIRE_WRONGKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.QUAGMIRE_WRONGKEY"
msgid "I'll have to find the right key."
msgstr "我必须找到正确的钥匙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.WRONGKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.WRONGKEY"
msgid "That may have been the wrong implement."
msgstr "那可能是错误的工具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.WRAPBUNDLE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.WRAPBUNDLE.EMPTY"
msgid "I have to know what to wrap, dear."
msgstr "我必须知道要打包什么，亲爱的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.WRITE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.WRITE.GENERIC"
msgid "I'd rather write in my own books."
msgstr "我宁愿在自己的书里写字。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.WRITE.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.WRITE.INUSE"
msgid "When you're done, dear."
msgstr "还没用完呢亲爱的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.ALREADYACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.ALREADYACTIVE"
msgid "I imagine there must be a competition going on elsewhere."
msgstr "我猜想其他地方一定还有个比赛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.DOESNTWORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.DOESNTWORK"
msgid "The contest will have to wait for the time being."
msgstr "比赛暂时还得等等。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.NORESPONSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.NORESPONSE"
msgid "It appears he has gone for a constitutional."
msgstr "他多半是去散步了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.RIGHTTHERE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.RIGHTTHERE"
msgid "He is currently engaged."
msgstr "他当下正忙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_UNLOCKSKIN.ALREADYKNOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_UNLOCKSKIN.ALREADYKNOWN"
msgid "I've already familiarized myself with this particular pattern."
msgstr "我已经熟悉了这个样式了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL_GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL_GENERIC"
msgid "It seems I can't do that."
msgstr "我似乎做不到。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT"
msgid "It's not there yet!"
msgstr "还没完成呢！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT_DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT_DONE"
msgid "File that under completed!"
msgstr "完成了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ACIDBATS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ACIDBATS"
msgid "What a dreadful noise they make."
msgstr "它们发出的噪音真可怕。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ADVENTUREFAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ADVENTUREFAIL"
msgid "We must learn from our failures."
msgstr "我们必须从失败中总结教训。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.1"
msgid "The ground will soon give way."
msgstr "地面快速让路。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.2"
msgid "Not the work of tectonic plates."
msgstr "这不是板块构造的结果。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_SINKHOLE.3"
msgid "A six on the Richter scale."
msgstr "里氏六级地震。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.1"
msgid "For you, great Panthera auropunctata."
msgstr "献给你，伟大的蚁狮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.2"
msgid "It ought to be more docile now."
msgstr "现在它应该更温顺了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ANTLION_TRIBUTE.3"
msgid "The great Panthera auropunctata is tamed."
msgstr "伟大的蚁狮被驯服了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_NEW_KNOWLEDGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_NEW_KNOWLEDGE"
msgid "What a peculiar sensation, it's transmitting a blueprint telepathically!"
msgstr "多么奇特的感觉，它在用心灵感应传送蓝图！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_NO_POWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_NO_POWER"
msgid "How very disappointing, I was curious to see what it would do."
msgstr "真是非常失望，我很想知道它的作用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_OLD_KNOWLEDGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_OLD_KNOWLEDGE"
msgid "I'm already familiar with this particular piece of knowledge."
msgstr "我对这种知识已经很熟悉了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.1"
msgid "I do believe it's time to go."
msgstr "我觉得该走了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.2"
msgid "It's dangerous to be here."
msgstr "待在这里太危险了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.3"
msgid "Goodness gracious!"
msgstr "仁慈的上帝！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_ATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_ATTACK"
msgid "My, I feel full of vim and vigor!"
msgstr "啊，我觉得充满了活力！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_ELECTRICATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_ELECTRICATTACK"
