msgstr "这是给我的，对吗？！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP"
