msgstr "缎带烧得真好！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE"
