msgstr "喂！回来！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG"
