#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
