msgstr "恶，它把它那奇怪的催眠垃圾滴得到处都是！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_SEED"
