#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST"
msgid "Setting one of these on fire would make the contest way more exciting."
msgstr "要是把其中一个点着了，一定会让比赛更刺激的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST_ITEM"
msgid "Here's an idea - instead of building it I just set it on fire!"
msgstr "我有个点子——干脆别造了，一把火烧了算了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE"
msgid "I never liked sewing."
msgstr "我从未喜欢过缝纫。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE_ITEM"
msgid "What a nice pile of kindling!"
msgstr "好漂亮的一堆柴火！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE"
msgid "You think you can judge me?!"
msgstr "你觉得你能评判我？！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM"
