msgstr "我讨厌蜘蛛！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.BATTLECRY.SPIDER_WARRIOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.BATTLECRY.SPIDER_WARRIOR"
