msgstr "被砍倒了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC"
