#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNING"
