msgstr "怎么把我留下来捡鸟嘴？哈！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER"
