msgstr "尝起来有点像...胡椒粉？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.GENERIC"
