msgstr "你最好迅速离开这里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.2"
