msgstr "即便是穿了这双‘海狸褐色’的乐福鞋，你也不应该游手好闲。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_loafers_orange_sienna
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_loafers_orange_sienna"
msgid "You probably shouldn't loaf around all day, even in these 'leaves in autumn orange' colored loafers."
msgstr "即便是穿了这双‘秋叶橙色’的乐福鞋，你也不应该游手好闲。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_loafers_tan_khaki
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_loafers_tan_khaki"
