msgstr "80%防御，+75最大生命值，提高蜘蛛宝宝、阿比盖尔或伯尼熊的作用"

#. STRINGS.UI.LAVAARENA_COMMUNITY_UNLOCKS.UNLOCKED_DESC.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HPRECHARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.LAVAARENA_COMMUNITY_UNLOCKS.UNLOCKED_DESC.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HPRECHARGER"
