msgstr "用灼热的炉火轰炸对手"

#. STRINGS.UI.LAVAARENA_COMMUNITY_UNLOCKS.UNLOCKED_DESC.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.LAVAARENA_COMMUNITY_UNLOCKS.UNLOCKED_DESC.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE"
